      "source": "Sets the API key using an <a href=\"../model/ApiKey.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.model\"><code>ApiKey</code></a> instance. Pass a <a href=\"../model/NoopApiKey.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.model\"><code>NoopApiKey</code></a> to\ndisable authentication (no <code>Authorization</code> header will be sent), which is\nthe same behavior as setting an empty string via <a href=\"#apiKey(java.lang.String)\"><code>apiKey(String)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用 <a href=\"../model/ApiKey.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.model\"><code>ApiKey</code></a> 实例设置 API 密钥。传递一个 <a href=\"../model/NoopApiKey.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.model\"><code>NoopApiKey</code></a> 以禁用身份验证（不会发送 <code>Authorization</code> 标头），其行为与通过 <a href=\"#apiKey(java.lang.String)\"><code>apiKey(String)</code></a> 设置空字符串相同。",
